---
title: Compass — find your match
description: A guided product-finder quiz built in one Markdown file. Four questions advance a state machine with :if branching, accumulate scores with :button actions, and a :computed recommendation lands the perfect pick. Zero hand-written JavaScript.
transitions: true
---

@include /nav.wd
@include /base.wd

<style>@keyframes pop { 0% { transform: scale(0) rotate(-18deg); opacity: 0 } 100% { transform: scale(1) rotate(0); opacity: 1 } }</style>

<main class="app-compass">

:state step = 1
:state calm = 0
:state bold = 0
:state budget = 0

::: section #quiz .compass-stage

::: compass-card .compass-card

:if step <= 4

::: compass-top .compass-top

::: eyebrow .compass-eyebrow
Question { step } of 4
:::

::: compass-rail .compass-rail .at-1 when step == 1 .at-2 when step == 2 .at-3 when step == 3 .at-4 when step == 4
:::

:::

:endif

:if step == 1

## Where should it live?

::: lead .compass-lead
Picture the spot you'd reach for it most. That tells us a lot.
:::

::: answers .compass-answers
:button "🛋️  A cozy nook to unwind" -> calm += 2; step++
:button "🎉  The room where people gather" -> bold += 2; step++
:button "🧺  Wherever — it should just be useful" -> budget += 2; step++
:::

:else if step == 2

## What's the mood you're after?

::: lead .compass-lead
No wrong answers. Go with your gut.
:::

::: answers .compass-answers
:button "🌙  Soft, calm, a little dreamy" -> calm += 2; step++
:button "⚡  Lively, bold, turn it up" -> bold += 2; step++
:button "🧘  Fresh and easy — no fuss" -> calm += 1; budget += 1; step++
:::

:else if step == 3

## How does it earn its keep?

::: lead .compass-lead
The thing it has to nail before anything else.
:::

::: answers .compass-answers
:button "✨  It sets the whole vibe" -> calm += 2; step++
:button "🔊  It fills the room" -> bold += 2; step++
:button "💧  It quietly makes the day nicer" -> calm += 1; budget += 1; step++
:::

:else if step == 4

## And the budget?

::: lead .compass-lead
Last one — then we'll find your match.
:::

::: answers .compass-answers
:button "🌱  Keep it gentle" -> budget += 3; step++
:button "⚖️  A fair middle" -> budget += 1; step++
:button "💎  Splurge for the right one" -> bold += 2; step++
:::

:else

::: result .compass-result

::: burst .compass-burst
🎉
:::

::: eyebrow .compass-eyebrow .is-result
Your match
:::

:if bold > calm and bold > budget

# The Cove Speaker

::: why .compass-why
You're here to fill the room. The **Cove Speaker** throws warm, room-filling 360° sound out of a palm-sized shell — the heart of every gathering, turned all the way up.
:::

